        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I go to the western union to reicive money from my fiance 200$usd and I am missing 7$ the girl didn't even know the exchange rate. I  pissed because I asked for it to be transferred in my account amd she gave or to me in cash. She was also very rude 😒",
        "time": 1720384008,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "I",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108048760151410679302/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUManiHIFmCsiMA_0NFHL-2iHd5YdiRHjt2q-HpbGhDKqW4m6_1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Horrible customer service. Would not assist with a western union transaction. Proceed to invent a policy of “ a limit”. Would not show me said policy written anywhere. In a rude tone continues to tell me they can’t help and will not do it. Had multiple employees approach and say the same useless sentence. No other solutions and no want to actually help their customers. Will never shop there again.",
        "time": 1718459128,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Murtada A",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112325295396955304546/reviews",
