      {
        "author_name": "Guy Valery AYISSI EYEBE",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114892872669324679985/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUhFgNhxlBte-dW7LZ1qtfFt0tU-8mfE7bO4lX26d8Wg_m8m0k=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "A 45-minute wait for a Western Union withdrawal, after the ordeal at another Super C that didn't warn me that if I came to the branch, I'd have to wait at least an hour. Does Super C really want to provide this service? Worse than no service, it's terrible service...\n\n...In the end, I couldn't complete my transaction. The manager informed me that Western Union transactions aren't a priority.\n\nIs there any way to make this clear to everyone: no transactions over $500, and Western Union customers aren't a priority and can wait 45 minutes without receiving any service?",
        "time": 1636222144,
        "translated": true
      }
